# Agent runtime-only Bedrock credentials.
# Copy to .env.agent_app.secret and keep that file out of source control.
# Load this overlay only in the Agent API and Agent worker. Backend, migration,
# verification, and telemetry-export processes must use their common env only.

AWS_BEARER_TOKEN_BEDROCK=
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=your-aws-access-key-id
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=your-aws-secret-access-key
# AWS_SESSION_TOKEN=your-aws-session-token
# AWS_PROFILE=your-aws-profile
